WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:41.835
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:42.105 --> 01:43.785
Mom, where are you now?

3
01:45.305 --> 01:47.145
Just past Innovation Industrial Park.

4
01:49.265 --> 01:50.625
You didn't reply to my text.

5
01:50.705 --> 01:52.905
I called just in case you missed your stop.

6
01:54.105 --> 01:55.465
I don't go out often,

7
01:55.545 --> 01:58.145
but I know how to read bus stop signs.

8
01:58.225 --> 01:59.345
What if you dozed off?

9
02:01.825 --> 02:03.665
That is possible.

10
02:05.545 --> 02:08.864
I used to always look down, volunteering and picking up trash with everyone.

11
02:09.785 --> 02:12.825
Now I've realized that our city is very beautiful.

12
02:12.905 --> 02:14.385
It's so scenic.

13
02:15.505 --> 02:17.545
If you like it, I'll tell Dad.

14
02:17.625 --> 02:18.905
In the future,

15
02:19.745 --> 02:20.985
we can go out more often.

16
02:21.585 --> 02:22.505
Sure.

17
02:23.065 --> 02:24.865
Let's all go out together.

18
02:26.705 --> 02:28.425
By the way, have you eaten yet?

19
02:28.505 --> 02:30.025
Doing experiments is tiring,

20
02:30.105 --> 02:31.985
but don't forget to eat.

21
02:33.945 --> 02:34.785
Hello?

22
02:35.905 --> 02:37.025
Hello?

23
02:54.225 --> 02:58.105
You're busy studying and writing a thesis.

24
02:58.185 --> 02:59.665
I already called a cab.

25
02:59.745 --> 03:00.985
It will be here soon.

26
03:01.065 --> 03:02.105
Yanzhou.

27
03:02.185 --> 03:03.505
I'll go with you.

28
03:14.345 --> 03:15.305
Where to?

29
03:16.865 --> 03:18.385
Innovation Industrial Park.

30
03:19.785 --> 03:21.025
No, wait.

31
03:21.105 --> 03:23.745
Go to the hospital. The closest one to that park.

32
03:24.545 --> 03:25.505
Okay.

33
03:43.145 --> 03:44.625
Sir, how much longer?

34
03:45.385 --> 03:48.625
It's all red on the GPS. Drivers are saying there was an accident.

35
03:49.265 --> 03:51.345
I really don't know how long it will take.

36
03:51.425 --> 03:52.545
An accident?

37
03:53.185 --> 03:56.145
-How far are we from the hospital? -Close to 3 km.

38
04:01.025 --> 04:02.705
Sir, I've already paid the fare.

39
04:02.785 --> 04:03.625
Okay, thank you.

40
04:06.025 --> 04:08.385
Dad, I've asked. It's this hospital.

41
04:18.865 --> 04:21.504
What exactly did Yanzhou say on the phone?

42
04:21.585 --> 04:23.625
He doesn't know the details either.

43
04:23.705 --> 04:26.065
Something happened to the bus that Ailan was on.

44
04:26.145 --> 04:28.265
I called Ailan but couldn't get through.

45
04:28.345 --> 04:31.105
I called the bus company, but the line was busy.

46
04:31.185 --> 04:33.505
Mom, Huaguang, don't panic.

47
04:33.585 --> 04:36.025
No news might actually be good news.

48
04:37.105 --> 04:38.665
Isn't that Yanzhou?

49
04:41.865 --> 04:43.785
-What happened? -Grandma.

50
04:43.865 --> 04:45.105
Why did you run here?

51
04:45.185 --> 04:47.265
Don't you know that you shouldn't run?

52
04:47.345 --> 04:49.825
Mom, let's not talk about that. Let's go inside.

53
04:49.905 --> 04:51.465
-Let's go. -Let's go inside.

54
04:55.745 --> 04:59.065
Nurse, were there any patients brought in from a bus accident?

55
04:59.145 --> 05:00.265
Over there.

56
05:01.905 --> 05:03.185
Thank you.

57
05:03.265 --> 05:04.465
You're welcome.

58
05:06.025 --> 05:07.985
The photos and videos are still here.

59
05:08.065 --> 05:08.905
That's great.

60
05:09.785 --> 05:12.865
Thank you. You've been working on this all afternoon.

61
05:12.945 --> 05:14.465
Of course, no problem.

62
05:14.545 --> 05:16.705
Yes, it should be over there.

63
05:18.025 --> 05:20.225
-It looks like she's fine. -Yanzhou?

64
05:20.945 --> 05:21.785
Why are you here?

65
05:23.585 --> 05:24.785
You all…

66
05:24.865 --> 05:26.665
Why are you all here?

67
05:26.745 --> 05:27.705
Are you okay?

68
05:27.785 --> 05:29.065
How are you?

69
05:29.145 --> 05:30.185
I'm fine.

70
05:32.305 --> 05:33.505
Chen Yanzhou.

71
05:35.505 --> 05:37.065
Why are you here?

72
05:37.145 --> 05:38.905
She was on the same bus as me.

73
05:38.985 --> 05:40.345
She went to pay my bill.

74
05:40.425 --> 05:41.785
I'm glad she was here.

75
05:41.865 --> 05:43.585
Thank you.

76
05:43.665 --> 05:45.065
Are you sure you're okay?

77
05:45.145 --> 05:48.065
I really am okay. The bus crashed into a stone bollard.

78
05:48.145 --> 05:49.545
The driver braked hard.

79
05:49.625 --> 05:52.145
I have a strained back and superficial injuries.

80
05:52.225 --> 05:53.265
It's nothing serious.

81
05:53.345 --> 05:54.465
You look so worried.

82
05:54.545 --> 05:55.385
She looks okay.

83
05:55.985 --> 05:57.585
Luckily, it was a minor accident.

84
05:58.185 --> 06:00.985
Aunt, we were taking Grandma out to eat.

85
06:01.065 --> 06:01.985
We had just left.

86
06:02.065 --> 06:04.745
When we heard the news, we were so worried.

87
06:04.825 --> 06:07.825
You're exaggerating. It's good that your aunt is fine.

88
06:07.905 --> 06:09.305
Why didn't you pick up?

89
06:14.705 --> 06:17.625
Did you forget that we were talking on the phone?

90
06:20.305 --> 06:21.305
All afternoon.

91
06:22.585 --> 06:24.945
Didn't it occur to you to tell me you were safe?

92
06:25.985 --> 06:28.505
I had dropped my phone, and the screen went black.

93
06:28.585 --> 06:30.545
It wouldn't turn on.

94
06:31.345 --> 06:33.825
I borrowed the nurse's phone to see how to fix it.

95
06:33.905 --> 06:36.945
I fixed it just before you all arrived.

96
06:37.665 --> 06:41.265
Fortunately, everything on the phone is intact.

97
06:41.345 --> 06:42.225
It's a miracle.

98
06:42.905 --> 06:43.945
Do you know

99
06:44.025 --> 06:46.545
how hard Yanzhou ran to find you?

100
06:47.145 --> 06:49.105
In the end, it's just a lousy phone.

101
06:49.185 --> 06:50.425
-Give it to me. -What?

102
06:50.505 --> 06:51.705
-Give me the phone! -Mom.

103
06:51.785 --> 06:54.625
-Give me the phone! -Don't take it! Don't take my phone!

104
06:56.305 --> 06:58.385
Ms. Zhou, long time no see.

105
06:58.465 --> 07:00.665
To attend this international summer camp,

106
07:00.745 --> 07:02.745
I couldn't go home for New Year's.

107
07:02.825 --> 07:04.785
If I had known, I wouldn't have come.

108
07:05.585 --> 07:07.905
Ms. Zhou, in this new year,

109
07:07.985 --> 07:09.345
may you continue to succeed

110
07:09.425 --> 07:12.145
and become the best environmental engineer.

111
07:13.185 --> 07:14.905
You're allowed to ditch us sometimes

112
07:14.985 --> 07:16.265
as long as you remember

113
07:16.345 --> 07:18.505
that we are always here for you.

114
07:19.105 --> 07:22.025
Mom, doesn't she have amnesia?

115
07:22.105 --> 07:23.945
Does she remember?

116
07:24.025 --> 07:24.865
By the way,

117
07:25.465 --> 07:28.545
I also filmed clips for Dad and Yanzhou.

118
07:28.625 --> 07:29.985
Yours is the longest.

119
07:40.945 --> 07:42.025
What does this mean?

120
07:43.305 --> 07:44.745
Today, did the crash

121
07:45.785 --> 07:47.905
knock you back to your senses?

122
07:48.665 --> 07:51.905
Or have you been lying to us all these years?

123
07:54.505 --> 07:55.905
What right do you have…

124
07:58.145 --> 07:59.065
to touch my phone?

125
07:59.145 --> 08:01.225
If I hadn't, I wouldn't have known!

126
08:03.105 --> 08:06.265
Every day, you appear to remember nothing.

127
08:07.145 --> 08:09.905
But it turns out you had us all fooled!

128
08:11.505 --> 08:12.785
If Xiaoqi

129
08:12.865 --> 08:15.705
knew that his mother was like this now…

130
08:15.785 --> 08:16.705
Mom,

131
08:17.345 --> 08:19.665
Ailan is injured right now.

132
08:19.745 --> 08:22.945
She's injured, so everything has to revolve around her?!

133
08:23.025 --> 08:26.065
These past years, haven't we played along long enough?

134
08:26.145 --> 08:28.265
Mom, this is a hospital.

135
08:28.345 --> 08:29.585
Let's not say all this.

136
08:29.665 --> 08:30.705
Not say all this?!

137
08:30.785 --> 08:32.505
I've barely begun to say anything!

138
08:32.585 --> 08:34.345
I was wrong, all right?

139
08:34.425 --> 08:36.225
Why did you have to take my phone?

140
08:36.305 --> 08:38.305
Would I have known otherwise?

141
08:38.385 --> 08:40.585
But you shouldn't have touched my phone!

142
08:40.664 --> 08:42.425
Why did you touch my phone?

143
08:42.505 --> 08:44.505
-Why can't I? -Why did you turn it on?

144
08:44.585 --> 08:46.385
What right do you have to touch it?

145
08:46.465 --> 08:47.305
Why can't I?

146
08:47.385 --> 08:50.385
I had to take your phone, or I wouldn't have known!

147
08:50.465 --> 08:52.105
Ma'am, your phone is fine. Look.

148
08:52.185 --> 08:54.505
Anger will make you sick.

149
08:55.185 --> 08:56.265
All right now.

150
08:56.345 --> 08:57.545
Look, it's fine.

151
08:57.625 --> 08:59.305
Your files are still here.

152
09:03.305 --> 09:06.385
I'll leave these reports with you.

153
09:06.465 --> 09:08.465
Your exam report looks fine.

154
09:08.545 --> 09:09.825
Get some rest. Bye now.

155
09:13.065 --> 09:16.385
How do you know my phone's passcode is 990508?

156
09:16.465 --> 09:19.945
I helped to fix your phone during Lunar New Year.

157
09:20.025 --> 09:22.185
Chen Yanzhou told me the passcode.

158
09:31.225 --> 09:32.545
990508.

159
09:35.865 --> 09:38.065
It's the day that Guanqi was born.

160
09:43.225 --> 09:48.025
So Yanzhou knew long ago.

161
10:06.105 --> 10:07.585
Don't lie there anymore.

162
10:08.545 --> 10:10.185
At least get up and eat a bit.

163
10:10.785 --> 10:12.425
I don't want to eat.

164
10:12.505 --> 10:14.145
Think about Yanzhou.

165
10:14.225 --> 10:16.345
He didn't speak much to begin with.

166
10:16.425 --> 10:18.345
Now he barely says a word.

167
10:18.425 --> 10:20.105
Come, get up.

168
10:20.185 --> 10:21.505
Go and talk to him.

169
10:21.585 --> 10:23.425
Sorry, I can't.

170
10:23.505 --> 10:25.185
Yanzhou is fortunate.

171
10:25.265 --> 10:27.185
He wasn't hurt much.

172
10:27.265 --> 10:29.145
But when I see him,

173
10:29.225 --> 10:31.585
I'm reminded of Guanqi.

174
10:31.665 --> 10:33.945
Guanqi was completely…

175
10:35.225 --> 10:36.945
I'm sorry, I can't help it.

176
10:38.025 --> 10:40.865
I can't help but think about him.

177
10:41.745 --> 10:43.185
Hello, Dad.

178
10:43.265 --> 10:45.625
I'm done with the exam. I'm on my way home.

179
10:45.705 --> 10:48.665
Yanzhou, don't go home yet. Come to the hospital.

180
10:48.745 --> 10:50.865
Your mom fell down the stairs.

181
10:50.945 --> 10:52.665
She's in the hospital now.

182
10:53.545 --> 10:55.505
Why did she fall?

183
10:56.105 --> 10:57.705
Don't ask so many questions.

184
10:57.785 --> 10:59.145
Be prepared.

185
10:59.225 --> 11:00.065
Your mom…

186
11:01.345 --> 11:03.025
Your mom lost her memories.

187
11:07.745 --> 11:09.065
PROPERTY MANAGEMENT

188
11:15.705 --> 11:17.345
-Hello. -Hello, Ms. Zhou.

189
11:17.425 --> 11:19.105
This is your property management.

190
11:19.185 --> 11:21.065
May I have two minutes of your time?

191
11:22.225 --> 11:23.465
What is it?

192
11:23.545 --> 11:25.745
To further enhance our community's security

193
11:25.825 --> 11:27.185
and ease of entry and exit,

194
11:27.265 --> 11:30.865
we will be upgrading the main gate security system this week

195
11:30.945 --> 11:32.625
and adding facial recognition.

196
11:32.705 --> 11:35.385
Detailed instructions on how to use it

197
11:35.465 --> 11:37.345
have been sent to you via text.

198
11:37.425 --> 11:40.185
We ask that you and your family register on our app

199
11:40.265 --> 11:41.705
as soon as possible.

200
11:41.785 --> 11:43.265
Okay, thank you.

201
11:45.785 --> 11:48.265
MS. ZHOU, TO COORDINATE WITH THE COMMUNITY'S GATE…

202
11:48.345 --> 11:49.585
ENTER PASSCODE

203
11:52.345 --> 11:53.505
Mom.

204
12:17.665 --> 12:18.825
Your mom is sleeping.

205
12:19.985 --> 12:20.905
What is it?

206
12:21.985 --> 12:22.985
Nothing.

207
12:25.625 --> 12:26.665
Dad.

208
12:28.145 --> 12:30.305
When you bought the phone for Mom,

209
12:30.385 --> 12:31.905
did you set the passcode?

210
12:31.985 --> 12:33.105
No.

211
12:33.185 --> 12:34.945
That's considered personal privacy.

212
12:35.025 --> 12:36.785
It's better if I don't know.

213
13:06.985 --> 13:08.705
Fatso, let's just go get the key.

214
13:08.785 --> 13:10.225
Who do we ask for the key?

215
13:10.305 --> 13:11.505
Mr. Li, right?

216
13:11.585 --> 13:14.465
Mr. Li won't be on campus anymore at this hour.

217
13:14.545 --> 13:15.545
Let's ask security.

218
13:15.625 --> 13:17.345
They should have the key.

219
13:17.425 --> 13:18.625
What happened?

220
13:31.665 --> 13:33.185
Not at home, not at the lab.

221
13:33.265 --> 13:34.825
He doesn't live on campus.

222
13:34.905 --> 13:35.905
Where can he go?

223
13:35.985 --> 13:39.665
Hello, Mr. Li. Did Chen Yanzhou contact you today?

224
13:39.745 --> 13:41.425
No, he didn't.

225
13:41.505 --> 13:44.425
His paper was rejected.

226
13:47.345 --> 13:48.865
The old lab.

227
13:56.945 --> 13:59.505
Wasn't that lab next door abandoned?

228
13:59.585 --> 14:01.465
Who knew there was thale cress inside?

229
14:01.545 --> 14:03.305
-And so many. -How tragic.

230
14:03.385 --> 14:05.545
Those had to be for experiments.

231
14:05.625 --> 14:07.105
-They're all ruined now. -Yes.

232
14:07.185 --> 14:08.225
Wait.

233
14:09.705 --> 14:11.345
What did you say is ruined?

234
14:12.185 --> 14:14.905
Lab 305 in the old building was disinfected today.

235
14:14.985 --> 14:18.065
The people in the lab thought the lab next door was abandoned

236
14:18.145 --> 14:19.025
and didn't notice.

237
14:19.105 --> 14:21.865
The disinfectant vapors traveled next door through the vent.

238
14:21.945 --> 14:24.585
Thale cress was being grown in the abandoned lab.

239
14:24.665 --> 14:26.465
After a day, they're all dead now.

240
15:11.585 --> 15:15.225
I was going to change the water for the thale cress at noon.

241
15:16.025 --> 15:16.945
But

242
15:17.785 --> 15:19.985
I couldn't reach my mom on the phone.

243
15:20.865 --> 15:22.745
And now, I come back to…

244
15:44.465 --> 15:47.305
When the immune system operates,

245
15:47.385 --> 15:50.705
it must distinguish between self and non-self.

246
15:52.225 --> 15:55.265
Sometimes, this complex system will crash,

247
15:55.345 --> 15:57.465
causing the system to mistake the self

248
15:57.545 --> 15:59.705
for a foreign body that needs to be removed.

249
16:00.505 --> 16:02.145
This person in front of me

250
16:03.145 --> 16:06.345
seems to have identified himself as a foreign body to be removed.

251
16:07.625 --> 16:09.425
It's so heartbreaking,

252
16:09.945 --> 16:11.785
to the point that my misfortune,

253
16:11.865 --> 16:13.625
my pride,

254
16:13.705 --> 16:15.985
and everything else that wears me down

255
16:17.225 --> 16:19.465
seems insignificant at this moment.

256
16:20.745 --> 16:22.065
All I know is

257
16:22.825 --> 16:24.625
that I cannot abandon

258
16:25.545 --> 16:27.345
this person in front of me.

259
16:30.745 --> 16:31.985
When you left,

260
16:32.065 --> 16:33.625
was my mom okay?

261
16:36.825 --> 16:39.305
I shouldn't have said those words.

262
16:39.385 --> 16:41.025
She was injured.

263
16:41.105 --> 16:42.705
I shouldn't have blamed her.

264
16:42.785 --> 16:43.745
You can blame her.

265
16:48.705 --> 16:50.505
What I mean is,

266
16:50.585 --> 16:52.985
you don't have to blame yourself for everything.

267
16:53.665 --> 16:58.225
Before I came here, I learned that your mom's phone passcode

268
16:58.305 --> 17:00.065
is your brother's birthdate.

269
17:01.185 --> 17:04.704
You knew long ago that she remembered everything.

270
17:10.145 --> 17:12.025
Why didn't you say anything?

271
17:15.184 --> 17:16.985
I was afraid she couldn't take it,

272
17:17.585 --> 17:22.065
just like how she fell down the stairs after my brother passed away.

273
17:23.145 --> 17:25.905
I was afraid I couldn't take it either.

274
17:25.985 --> 17:27.545
I was afraid

275
17:27.625 --> 17:31.345
of causing an irreversible situation like six years ago.

276
17:34.065 --> 17:36.985
I thought that if I worked hard to follow in my brother's footsteps,

277
17:38.465 --> 17:41.785
even if I made a mistake that can't be undone,

278
17:41.865 --> 17:43.345
at least

279
17:44.505 --> 17:46.425
I could bring comfort to everyone.

280
17:50.505 --> 17:52.545
You don't need to learn calligraphy.

281
17:52.625 --> 17:54.785
You don't need to eat foods you don't like.

282
17:56.145 --> 17:59.185
Nor do you need to replace "Mom" with "Ms. Zhou."

283
17:59.265 --> 18:01.745
You can be yourself.

284
18:01.825 --> 18:03.625
You don't need to comfort anyone.

285
18:04.865 --> 18:07.945
Because surviving that accident

286
18:08.025 --> 18:09.705
is a comfort in itself.

287
18:39.345 --> 18:40.465
Yanzhou.

288
20:26.465 --> 20:29.545
CHLORPHENIRAMINE MALEATE

289
20:36.305 --> 20:39.225
NOTOGINSENG MIND CALMING TABLETS

290
20:46.625 --> 20:48.785
FOR USE IN ALLEVIATING SYMPTOMS OF ALLERGIC REACTIONS

291
20:50.665 --> 20:51.905
I learned only recently

292
20:52.505 --> 20:55.545
that some people are allergic to eggs.

293
20:55.625 --> 20:58.105
Are there people who are allergic to eggs?

294
20:58.185 --> 21:01.345
Especially people who have been seriously ill.

295
21:02.145 --> 21:03.905
They may seem to have recovered,

296
21:03.985 --> 21:06.265
but their bodies have weakened immunity

297
21:06.345 --> 21:08.225
and develop new allergies.

298
21:12.265 --> 21:14.665
FLUPENTIXOL AND MELITRACEN TABLETS

299
21:16.905 --> 21:17.825
Mom.

300
21:19.025 --> 21:21.585
I don't like scrambled eggs with tomatoes now.

301
21:22.345 --> 21:24.425
Didn't you still like it not long ago?

302
21:26.105 --> 21:28.425
People's preferences can change.

303
21:28.505 --> 21:31.465
I can share my preferences, right?

304
22:39.705 --> 22:40.825
Mom.

305
22:45.945 --> 22:47.905
-Sor-- -Sorry.

306
23:14.865 --> 23:16.145
Sorry.

307
23:22.105 --> 23:23.345
I'm sorry.

308
23:34.865 --> 23:36.225
I'm sorry.

309
23:40.305 --> 23:41.625
It's my fault.

310
23:46.745 --> 23:48.385
I'm sorry.

311
23:54.065 --> 23:55.545
Sorry.

312
24:02.105 --> 24:03.545
I feel that

313
24:05.025 --> 24:07.145
I am such a failure as a mother.

314
24:12.185 --> 24:14.345
After losing your brother…

315
24:16.585 --> 24:18.465
I asked myself these questions every day.

316
24:19.065 --> 24:21.505
If I'd been the one who'd gone with you that day…

317
24:23.465 --> 24:26.905
would I have been the one who died instead?

318
24:29.585 --> 24:31.785
If I'd been driving that day,

319
24:31.865 --> 24:33.865
would I have taken a different route?

320
24:34.865 --> 24:37.425
If I had called him to warn him more than I did,

321
24:37.505 --> 24:39.985
would the outcome have been different?

322
24:43.905 --> 24:45.425
You and your dad

323
24:46.905 --> 24:48.505
must have been the same as me.

324
24:50.305 --> 24:54.625
Your minds must also have been filled with these hypothetical what-ifs.

325
24:57.145 --> 24:58.385
I know

326
24:59.305 --> 25:01.545
it was really hard to accept.

327
25:04.985 --> 25:06.145
Later on,

328
25:06.225 --> 25:09.705
I accidentally fell down the stairs.

329
25:11.225 --> 25:13.505
When I woke up, I had lost my memory.

330
25:17.145 --> 25:20.305
You and your dad played along with me…

331
25:22.705 --> 25:24.865
never talking about Guanqi.

332
25:28.665 --> 25:29.945
But…

333
25:33.105 --> 25:34.945
But soon after, I remembered it all.

334
25:39.465 --> 25:41.745
On the day that my memory returned,

335
25:42.705 --> 25:43.705
I rushed downstairs.

336
26:02.025 --> 26:03.625
I saw you and your dad

337
26:03.705 --> 26:05.545
waving me over with smiles.

338
26:09.065 --> 26:12.625
I wondered if continuing like this would be best for everyone.

339
26:16.145 --> 26:20.225
If I didn't show my pain…

340
26:22.465 --> 26:24.465
would it not hurt as much?

341
26:28.825 --> 26:30.305
I am such a fool.

342
26:32.985 --> 26:36.065
I didn't even consider what my kind child

343
26:37.225 --> 26:39.305
was enduring.

344
26:40.985 --> 26:43.585
Look how you have worn yourself out.

345
26:43.665 --> 26:45.705
Why didn't I ever notice?

346
26:47.785 --> 26:48.985
Or perhaps…

347
26:51.105 --> 26:52.865
I chose to turn a blind eye.

348
26:59.865 --> 27:01.185
I'm sorry.

349
27:05.665 --> 27:08.185
I lost one child.

350
27:10.305 --> 27:12.625
And yet, I'm hurting my other child.

351
27:16.145 --> 27:17.585
Sorry.

352
27:20.785 --> 27:22.785
I'm the one who should apologize.

353
27:24.225 --> 27:26.025
I understood too late.

354
27:27.825 --> 27:30.665
I thought not mentioning my brother would make you happy.

355
27:34.625 --> 27:36.025
But I failed to consider

356
27:36.785 --> 27:39.385
that if Guanqi ever came back to see us

357
27:39.465 --> 27:41.265
and we had forgotten him,

358
27:42.625 --> 27:44.145
he would be so upset.

359
27:51.425 --> 27:52.865
You're right.

360
27:57.065 --> 27:58.305
Yanzhou,

361
27:59.225 --> 28:00.545
if

362
28:01.385 --> 28:03.025
you ever miss your brother,

363
28:04.145 --> 28:05.545
you must tell me.

364
28:06.385 --> 28:07.825
You must say so.

365
28:08.425 --> 28:09.705
All right?

366
28:10.785 --> 28:11.625
Okay.

367
28:12.745 --> 28:15.385
Then we will visit him as a family.

368
28:17.025 --> 28:18.825
How do you want to remember him?

369
28:18.905 --> 28:21.345
The things related to him, what you remember,

370
28:21.425 --> 28:24.465
the things you know or don't know,

371
28:25.945 --> 28:27.305
I can tell you everything.

372
28:29.025 --> 28:30.105
Okay.

373
28:45.025 --> 28:49.305
Yanzhou, the university learned about the disinfection incident

374
28:49.385 --> 28:51.305
and decided to take back the key.

375
28:51.385 --> 28:53.865
Actually, even without this incident,

376
28:53.945 --> 28:57.025
this building was set to be renovated this summer.

377
28:57.705 --> 29:00.945
After all, renovation is easier than reconstruction.

378
29:01.025 --> 29:03.905
Unfortunately, the university kept dragging its feet until now.

379
29:03.985 --> 29:07.185
But now, it's time to take the plunge.

380
29:36.025 --> 29:37.705
Where are the things you packed?

381
29:39.865 --> 29:41.985
I seem to recall I invited you to have dinner with me,

382
29:42.065 --> 29:43.385
not to hire you to move things.

383
29:44.185 --> 29:45.025
No charge.

384
29:46.945 --> 29:49.785
I ran into the cleaning lady and gave everything to her.

385
29:49.865 --> 29:51.225
I'm only taking some books.

386
29:52.705 --> 29:53.825
Then let's go.

387
29:56.145 --> 29:58.945
Isn't your backpack heavy with all those books?

388
30:00.905 --> 30:02.425
I've even carried you home.

389
30:03.585 --> 30:06.025
All right, enough about that.

390
30:08.625 --> 30:11.065
Have you noticed you talk more than before now?

391
30:13.385 --> 30:14.745
Then I'm not talking anymore.

392
30:15.425 --> 30:18.465
Keep talking or you might burst.

393
30:20.345 --> 30:22.705
Dad, Mom, we're back.

394
30:26.385 --> 30:27.465
Hello, sir, ma'am.

395
30:27.545 --> 30:28.905
Welcome.

396
30:31.065 --> 30:32.905
The food will take a while.

397
30:32.985 --> 30:35.025
-There's some fruit there. Try some. -Okay.

398
30:49.105 --> 30:49.945
Try some.

399
31:18.185 --> 31:19.545
Gao Xing left that.

400
31:20.265 --> 31:23.465
She said no when I offered to bring it to her. I don't know why.

401
31:24.425 --> 31:26.665
Kids her age don't like to wear their school uniforms.

402
31:49.185 --> 31:50.585
Stop following me.

403
31:54.105 --> 31:55.385
This seems to be my house.

404
31:56.545 --> 31:59.345
Exactly, it's your house. Your parents are here.

405
32:05.785 --> 32:06.945
Let's eat.

406
32:08.905 --> 32:09.865
Come.

407
33:03.665 --> 33:05.065
Chen Yanzhou,

408
33:06.305 --> 33:08.265
I once saw a film

409
33:08.985 --> 33:10.505
that said

410
33:11.145 --> 33:13.265
death isn't the end of life.

411
33:14.105 --> 33:16.745
As long as we are still telling a person's story,

412
33:16.825 --> 33:18.625
they will not bow out.

413
33:20.905 --> 33:23.545
No solemn commemoration needed.

414
33:23.625 --> 33:25.945
No monumental reconciliation needed.

415
33:27.585 --> 33:30.385
Just when you least expect it,

416
33:30.465 --> 33:32.785
their name slips out.

417
33:33.905 --> 33:35.945
That is a reunion.

418
33:58.345 --> 34:00.705
Your house has a lot more photos now.

419
34:02.705 --> 34:03.785
My mom compiled a lot.

420
34:05.025 --> 34:06.505
You're quite observant.

421
34:07.265 --> 34:08.824
It's getting familiar.

422
34:08.905 --> 34:11.304
This is my third time coming to your house.

423
34:14.304 --> 34:16.865
Why did you laugh? Did I remember wrong?

424
34:18.865 --> 34:20.105
Come often.

425
34:25.225 --> 34:26.185
I forgot to ask.

426
34:27.545 --> 34:30.304
That night, you were waiting here.

427
34:30.385 --> 34:32.145
Was it to give papers to Gao Xing,

428
34:32.225 --> 34:33.905
or to wish me a happy birthday?

429
34:34.585 --> 34:36.905
That day, you were in an awful mood.

430
34:36.985 --> 34:38.905
My well-wishes seemed useless.

431
34:40.105 --> 34:41.545
That means

432
34:41.625 --> 34:44.185
you waited here just to wish me a happy birthday?

433
34:51.025 --> 34:52.784
It wasn't that they were useless.

434
34:54.025 --> 34:56.264
In fact, it wasn't my birthday.

435
34:57.145 --> 34:58.745
Then when is your birthday?

436
35:00.865 --> 35:01.705
It's a secret.

437
35:02.945 --> 35:03.785
Just wait.

438
35:03.865 --> 35:08.465
The next time my birthday comes around, I expect your well-wishes with interest.

439
35:10.145 --> 35:11.745
I'll pay up now.

440
35:11.825 --> 35:13.825
I can't afford the compound interest.

441
35:15.625 --> 35:16.465
Now?

442
35:24.425 --> 35:25.305
Are you sure?

443
35:26.545 --> 35:27.385
I…

444
35:29.585 --> 35:30.745
I…

445
35:30.825 --> 35:32.105
Maybe next time, then.

446
36:01.505 --> 36:02.785
Did you win the lottery?

447
36:03.985 --> 36:04.865
No.

448
36:05.785 --> 36:08.585
Then why are you smiling? Tell me. Share the joy.

449
36:08.665 --> 36:09.665
I said I didn't.

450
36:09.745 --> 36:10.785
Walk faster.

451
36:10.865 --> 36:12.185
Zheng Yu is waiting.

452
36:12.265 --> 36:13.465
Chen Yanzhou.

453
36:16.025 --> 36:19.225
We used to be in the same year. We had an elective course together.

454
36:19.305 --> 36:22.185
Then you went on leave, and we lost touch.

455
36:24.785 --> 36:26.225
Sorry, I don't remember.

456
36:27.825 --> 36:29.065
That's okay.

457
36:29.145 --> 36:30.785
Well…

458
36:36.025 --> 36:37.265
I'll let you two talk.

459
36:37.985 --> 36:38.945
I'll wait up ahead.

460
36:41.665 --> 36:44.585
Our college had our thesis defense today. I passed.

461
36:45.425 --> 36:47.745
So I'm afraid I won't get another chance

462
36:47.825 --> 36:49.145
to say what I want to say.

463
36:54.305 --> 36:56.385
Chen Yanzhou, do you

464
36:57.025 --> 36:57.905
have a girlfriend?

465
37:01.785 --> 37:03.145
There's someone I like.

466
37:04.745 --> 37:07.425
Have a happy graduation. Bye.

467
37:11.905 --> 37:13.265
Done eavesdropping?

468
37:13.865 --> 37:14.865
My neck has a kink.

469
37:15.465 --> 37:16.625
-Let's go. -Eavesdropping?

470
37:16.705 --> 37:18.385
Am I that kind of person?

471
37:19.865 --> 37:22.425
"Have a happy graduation. Bye."

472
37:23.865 --> 37:25.545
You weren't there.

473
37:25.625 --> 37:27.305
It was swift and decisive.

474
37:27.905 --> 37:30.025
Isn't it nice to be liked?

475
37:32.425 --> 37:34.065
It might be a blessing to others,

476
37:34.145 --> 37:36.385
but to him, it's like a death sentence.

477
37:38.745 --> 37:39.985
What do you mean?

478
37:41.425 --> 37:43.705
He told her that there's someone he likes.

479
37:45.705 --> 37:47.305
The three of us

480
37:47.385 --> 37:49.305
are in the lab together every day.

481
37:50.225 --> 37:52.025
Where did this crush come from?

482
37:52.105 --> 37:54.945
That's why I think…

483
38:04.185 --> 38:05.785
It's an excuse to turn her down.

484
38:08.265 --> 38:09.505
Says who?

485
38:10.585 --> 38:12.065
Refuting me?

486
38:12.145 --> 38:13.625
Do you really have a crush?

487
38:19.585 --> 38:20.465
Yes.

488
38:21.065 --> 38:22.265
And…

489
38:23.745 --> 38:25.145
I really like her.

490
38:38.785 --> 38:39.905
Cheesy.

491
38:41.785 --> 38:42.945
So cheesy.

492
38:44.105 --> 38:46.905
Why are you pretending in front of the two of us?

493
38:48.905 --> 38:50.345
No, wait a second.

494
38:51.705 --> 38:53.825
At the boss's birthday party,

495
38:54.985 --> 38:56.505
you folded your finger.

496
38:57.585 --> 38:59.225
Are you really dating?

497
39:00.145 --> 39:01.225
Who did you kiss?

498
39:01.305 --> 39:03.305
Is she from our university? Which college?

499
39:04.105 --> 39:05.265
Bi Dezheng,

500
39:05.345 --> 39:08.385
didn't you have something to say?

501
39:08.985 --> 39:10.625
What's more important than this?

502
39:16.305 --> 39:17.385
Yes.

503
39:17.905 --> 39:19.065
Let's get down to business.

504
39:22.265 --> 39:23.625
You two are such killjoys.

505
39:23.705 --> 39:25.425
Fine.

506
39:25.505 --> 39:27.225
I wanted to ask when you are free.

507
39:27.825 --> 39:30.545
We can go to a public beach to get a seawater sample.

508
39:30.625 --> 39:32.945
Chen Yanzhou can drive, right?

509
39:33.025 --> 39:34.985
Zheng Yu and I can get a lift.

510
39:35.665 --> 39:37.905
But I haven't decided which beach.

511
39:39.065 --> 39:41.985
How about Qingshan Island?

512
39:42.065 --> 39:44.305
Fine by me. What about you?

513
39:45.305 --> 39:46.145
No problem.

514
39:46.985 --> 39:49.985
But I have to arrange leave with the student I tutor.

515
39:56.025 --> 39:57.345
Jiang Mian.

516
39:57.985 --> 40:00.545
What took you so long? I've been waiting a while.

517
40:00.625 --> 40:01.825
For me?

518
40:02.745 --> 40:05.265
Here's your uniform. So you have something to wear.

519
40:05.345 --> 40:06.385
I've washed it.

520
40:06.465 --> 40:07.625
I thought you forgot.

521
40:07.705 --> 40:09.505
What do you take me for?

522
40:09.585 --> 40:10.705
Leaving already?

523
40:12.305 --> 40:13.385
MS. ZHENG

524
40:14.025 --> 40:15.265
Hi, Ms. Zheng.

525
40:20.905 --> 40:22.265
You need time off?

526
40:23.065 --> 40:24.905
Reschedule the weekend session?

527
40:25.505 --> 40:26.705
But

528
40:26.785 --> 40:29.305
final exams are coming up.

529
40:29.385 --> 40:31.065
You're putting me in a tight spot.

530
40:31.665 --> 40:34.425
What's more important than tutoring me?

531
40:35.705 --> 40:36.905
Lab stuff?

532
40:37.985 --> 40:39.945
Can't you just push through?

533
40:40.825 --> 40:41.905
All right.

534
40:41.985 --> 40:43.785
I'll find another way.

535
40:44.625 --> 40:46.345
What? You can't push through?

536
40:46.425 --> 40:48.705
Ms. Zheng, this attitude of yours…

537
40:48.785 --> 40:49.745
AGREE TO IT

538
40:50.985 --> 40:54.585
Gao Xing, what are you talking about?

539
40:54.665 --> 40:57.425
Didn't I just say I'd find another way?

540
40:57.505 --> 41:00.265
Getting samples isn't hard. I can ask my other teammates to go.

541
41:00.345 --> 41:01.345
I'LL TUTOR YOU

542
41:05.225 --> 41:07.025
Ms. Zheng, I just remembered

543
41:07.105 --> 41:08.865
I also have plans this weekend.

544
41:08.945 --> 41:11.745
You can tutor me when you get back.

545
41:11.825 --> 41:12.665
Bye.

546
41:13.785 --> 41:15.385
You had better keep your word.

547
41:15.465 --> 41:16.985
Of course.

548
41:17.065 --> 41:19.505
I'm free both days of the weekend. What about you?

549
41:33.545 --> 41:34.785
Get in.

550
41:47.945 --> 41:49.545
Do you know where Bi Dezheng is?

551
41:52.625 --> 41:53.545
BI DEZHENG

552
41:53.625 --> 41:54.705
ANSWER

553
41:55.865 --> 41:56.945
Where are you?

554
41:57.025 --> 41:58.585
My advisor suddenly told me

555
41:58.665 --> 42:00.065
to go to his office.

556
42:01.105 --> 42:02.985
So

557
42:03.065 --> 42:03.945
you're not coming.

558
42:04.025 --> 42:05.785
Yes, I can't come.

559
42:11.505 --> 42:14.185
It's such a shame that we can't go as a team.

560
42:14.785 --> 42:16.465
I can't talk. You guys go ahead.

561
42:17.385 --> 42:18.545
Bye then.

562
42:25.865 --> 42:27.225
He flaked on us.

563
42:27.305 --> 42:28.825
Why do you look kind of happy?

564
42:30.265 --> 42:31.505
Do I?

565
42:32.865 --> 42:34.945
I just think

566
42:35.025 --> 42:36.825
the weather is great today.

567
42:45.585 --> 42:47.345
Are we setting out yet?

568
42:49.225 --> 42:50.665
Are you sitting there?

569
42:51.465 --> 42:52.585
What's wrong?
